  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Lu Wei Yin’s reforming dream realm, a Shu clan elder judges that a mere mortal improving his aptitude to reach rank two must be hiding a huge secret, and attacks Fang Yuan over it. Fighting past his limit, Fang Yuan uses mortal killer move Virtuous Submission, and the move uses up all of his accumulate virtue Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_accumulate_virtue_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin built this dream realm’s Virtue true inheritance himself, a crucial and genuine setup rather than a fiction.",
      "chapters": [
        1543
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_virtue_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The elder takes no injury from the move. Instead he kneels, slaps his own face, and weeps, begging forgiveness for attacking someone so virtuous. Fang Yuan is dazed that the move proves this powerful. Fang Yuan subdues the elder and gains a great deal of crucial information about the Shu clan young master.",
      "chapters": [
